    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a game engine and XR toolkit you can use in real time with your friends. ever wanted to have a world where you have absolute control over every aspect of the virtual space? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >barkvr is that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we've developed a set of tools and systems on top of the Godot game engine that lets you edit the very game your sitting in. not only can you edit every aspect of the game world (scripts, shaders, meshes, etc) you are in, you can do it with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >import anything, make anything</p>",
